    cleared+relaunched fresh by the next telemetry tick) instead of a bare
    Claude ``/compact`` whose summarization would just be thrown away the
    moment the handoff kills the pane anyway. Falls back to the legacy
    ``/compact`` only when no destination (task Context / role artifact)
    resolves, or the session has no telemetry record yet to arm."""
    sid = require_sid(args.sid)
    res = post("compact", {"sid": sid})
    kind = res.get("kind")
